│ passed as filters to the search/query tool.                                  │
│ Procedure:                                                                   │
│   1. Map EVERY constraint stated in the task into the matching search        │
│ argument (status/list_name, board, due_date, product, etc.).                 │
│   2. Do NOT search by identity alone and then act on all results — filter to │
│ exactly what the task specifies. If the filtered search returns nothing, do  │
│ nothing.                                                                     │
│ Rationale: Omitting a stated filter returns too many records and causes      │
│ wrong or excess mutations.                                                   │
│ Applies to: Search/query tools with multiple optional filters (search_tasks, │
│ search_emails, search_customers, search_events).                             │
